                <rule id="r69-ws-hasik-bike-rule" name="Space Marine Bike" hidden="false">
                  <description>The character becomes Bike unit type and follows the normal ProHammer Bike rules. The bike is armed with twin-linked bolters.

Twin-Linked: Re-roll failed To Hit rolls with this weapon. Does not count as two weapons. Twin-linked Template weapons automatically hit all models fully or partially under the Template.</description>
